# `.env` alone did not cover the variants an edit leaves behind (.env.bak-*,
# .env.local, .env.save). This repo is deliberately PUBLIC, so a single
# `git add -A` over an untracked backup would publish the Neon URL and every
# bot token. Ignore the whole family; keep the committed example.
